---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro'

const title = '字节今天吃什么'
---

<PageLayout meta={{ title }} highlightColor='#e36d2f'>
  <main class='canteen-page'>
    <section class='hero-panel'>
      <div class='hero-copy'>
        <p class='eyebrow'>Byte canteen roulette</p>
        <h1>字节今天吃什么</h1>
        <p class='hero-text'>
          先按楼宇缩小范围，再让转盘替你做决定。这个原型先支持 JSON
          导入，后面可以把字节餐厅小程序的数据接到同一套结构里。
        </p>

        <div class='hero-actions'>
          <button class='primary-btn' id='spin-action' type='button'>转一次，今天就吃它</button>
          <button class='ghost-btn' id='load-sample' type='button'>载入示例菜单</button>
        </div>

        <div class='status-strip' aria-live='polite'>
          <div>
            <span class='status-label'>当前楼宇</span>
            <strong id='current-building'>全部楼宇</strong>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class='status-label'>候选菜品</span>
            <strong id='candidate-count'>0</strong>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class='status-label'>随机结果</span>
            <strong id='result-brief'>等待开转</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class='wheel-stage'>
        <div class='wheel-pointer' aria-hidden='true'>
          <span></span>
        </div>
        <div class='wheel-shell'>
          <div class='wheel-face' id='wheel-face'>
            <svg id='wheel-svg' viewBox='0 0 520 520' role='img' aria-label='午餐随机转盘'></svg>
          </div>
          <div class='wheel-hub'>午饭</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class='control-grid'>
      <article class='control-card filter-card'>
        <div class='card-heading'>
          <p class='card-kicker'>01 / 楼宇过滤</p>
          <h2>先决定你今天在哪栋楼吃</h2>
        </div>
        <div class='building-chips' id='building-chips'></div>
        <label class='field-label' for='building-select'>或使用下拉选择</label>
        <select id='building-select' class='field-select'></select>
      </article>

      <article class='control-card import-card'>
        <div class='card-heading'>
          <p class='card-kicker'>02 / 菜单导入</p>
          <h2>先接 JSON，后面再接小程序</h2>
        </div>

        <div class='import-actions'>
          <label class='upload-btn'>
            <input id='file-input' type='file' accept='.json,application/json' />
            上传 JSON 文件
          </label>
          <button class='ghost-btn small' id='apply-json' type='button'>导入下方文本</button>
        </div>

        <textarea
          id='json-input'
          class='json-input'
          spellcheck='false'
          placeholder='粘贴 JSON 数组，例如：[{"building":"A座","restaurant":"一食堂","stall":"面档","dish":"番茄肥牛面"}]'
        ></textarea>

        <p class='helper-text' id='import-message'>
          支持字段：building、restaurant、stall、dish、tags、price。也兼容
          campus、canteen、window、name 这类近义字段。
        </p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class='result-grid'>
      <article class='result-card spotlight-card'>
        <div class='card-heading'>
          <p class='card-kicker'>03 / 今日结果</p>
          <h2>别纠结，先吃到嘴里</h2>
        </div>

        <div class='result-ticket empty' id='result-ticket'>
          <p class='ticket-building'>等待转盘</p>
          <h3>载入菜单后，按下“转一次”</h3>
          <p class='ticket-meta'>这里会显示楼宇、餐厅、档口、标签和价格。</p>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class='result-card data-card'>
        <div class='card-heading'>
          <p class='card-kicker'>04 / 候选池</p>
          <h2>当前楼宇可选菜单</h2>
        </div>

        <div class='candidate-list' id='candidate-list'></div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class='roadmap-panel'>
      <div class='card-heading'>
        <p class='card-kicker'>下一步 / 接字节餐厅小程序</p>
        <h2>原型已经把导入层留出来了</h2>
      </div>
      <p>
        这版先用统一 JSON 结构跑通“分楼宇 +
        随机转盘”。后续如果你要接字节餐厅小程序，建议优先研究它是否有稳定的接口返回菜品、楼宇和窗口信息；如果能拿到接口响应，就把结果映射成同样的字段结构直接灌进来。如果小程序接口做了强登录、签名或频控，再退一步做手动导出或半自动同步，会比直接硬爬更稳。
      </p>
      <div class='schema-board'>
        <div>
          <span class='schema-label'>building</span>
          <strong>楼宇</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class='schema-label'>restaurant</span>
          <strong>餐厅</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class='schema-label'>stall</span>
          <strong>档口</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class='schema-label'>dish</span>
          <strong>菜品名</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class='schema-label'>tags</span>
          <strong>标签数组</strong>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class='schema-label'>price</span>
          <strong>价格</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script is:inline>
    const samplePath = '/bytedance-eat-wheel.sample.json'

    const palette = [
      '#F26A2E',
      '#FF9F1C',
      '#FFD166',
      '#06A77D',
      '#118AB2',
      '#7A5CFA',
      '#EF476F',
      '#4D5156'
    ]

    const state = {
      sourceData: [],
      filteredData: [],
      buildings: [],
      selectedBuilding: 'all',
      currentRotation: 0,
      spinning: false,
      lastResult: null
    }

    const nodes = {
      wheelFace: document.getElementById('wheel-face'),
      wheelSvg: document.getElementById('wheel-svg'),
      spinAction: document.getElementById('spin-action'),
      loadSample: document.getElementById('load-sample'),
      buildingChips: document.getElementById('building-chips'),
      buildingSelect: document.getElementById('building-select'),
      candidateList: document.getElementById('candidate-list'),
      candidateCount: document.getElementById('candidate-count'),
      currentBuilding: document.getElementById('current-building'),
      resultBrief: document.getElementById('result-brief'),
      resultTicket: document.getElementById('result-ticket'),
      jsonInput: document.getElementById('json-input'),
      applyJson: document.getElementById('apply-json'),
      importMessage: document.getElementById('import-message'),
      fileInput: document.getElementById('file-input')
    }

    function splitTags(tags) {
      if (Array.isArray(tags)) return tags.filter(Boolean).map(String)
      if (typeof tags === 'string') {
        return tags
          .split(/[、,，|/]/)
          .map((item) => item.trim())
          .filter(Boolean)
      }
      return []
    }

    function normalizeRecord(record) {
      if (!record || typeof record !== 'object') return null

      const normalized = {
        building: String(
          record.building ?? record.campus ?? record.location ?? record.site ?? '未分楼宇'
        ).trim(),
        restaurant: String(
          record.restaurant ?? record.canteen ?? record.cafeteria ?? '未标注餐厅'
        ).trim(),
        stall: String(record.stall ?? record.window ?? record.counter ?? '未标注档口').trim(),
        dish: String(record.dish ?? record.name ?? record.title ?? '').trim(),
        tags: splitTags(record.tags ?? record.labels ?? record.tag),
        price: record.price == null || record.price === '' ? '' : String(record.price).trim()
      }

      if (!normalized.dish) return null
      return normalized
    }

    function setImportMessage(message, tone = 'muted') {
      nodes.importMessage.textContent = message
      nodes.importMessage.dataset.tone = tone
    }

    function loadData(records, sourceLabel = '新数据') {
      const normalized = records.map(normalizeRecord).filter(Boolean)
      if (!normalized.length) {
        setImportMessage(
          '没有识别到有效菜品。请检查 JSON 是否为数组，并至少包含 dish/name 字段。',
          'error'
        )
        return
      }

      state.sourceData = normalized
      state.selectedBuilding = 'all'
      state.lastResult = null
      state.currentRotation = 0
      nodes.wheelFace.style.transform = 'rotate(0deg)'
      setImportMessage(`已导入 ${normalized.length} 条菜品，来源：${sourceLabel}。`, 'success')
      renderAll()
    }

    function getBuildings() {
      return Array.from(new Set(state.sourceData.map((item) => item.building))).sort((a, b) =>
        a.localeCompare(b, 'zh-Hans-CN')
      )
    }

    function applyFilter() {
      state.buildings = getBuildings()
      state.filteredData =
        state.selectedBuilding === 'all'
          ? [...state.sourceData]
          : state.sourceData.filter((item) => item.building === state.selectedBuilding)
    }

    function formatPrice(price) {
      return price ? `¥${price}` : '价格待补充'
    }

    function truncate(text, length = 12) {
      return text.length > length ? `${text.slice(0, length)}…` : text
    }

    function polarToCartesian(cx, cy, radius, angle) {
      const radians = ((angle - 90) * Math.PI) / 180
      return {
        x: cx + radius * Math.cos(radians),
        y: cy + radius * Math.sin(radians)
      }
    }

    function describeSector(cx, cy, radius, startAngle, endAngle) {
      const start = polarToCartesian(cx, cy, radius, endAngle)
      const end = polarToCartesian(cx, cy, radius, startAngle)
      const largeArcFlag = endAngle - startAngle <= 180 ? '0' : '1'
      return `M ${cx} ${cy} L ${start.x} ${start.y} A ${radius} ${radius} 0 ${largeArcFlag} 0 ${end.x} ${end.y} Z`
    }

    function renderWheel() {
      const items = state.filteredData
      const svg = nodes.wheelSvg
      svg.innerHTML = ''

      if (!items.length) {
        svg.innerHTML = `
          <circle cx="260" cy="260" r="220" fill="#F7EEDF"></circle>
          <circle cx="260" cy="260" r="185" fill="#FFF8EC" stroke="#D8C4A8" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="10 8"></circle>
          <text x="260" y="238" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6C6257" font-size="24" font-weight="700">先导入菜单</text>
          <text x="260" y="278" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8A7F71" font-size="14">支持 JSON 文件或粘贴 JSON 数组</text>
        `
        return
      }

      const slice = 360 / items.length
      const center = 260
      const radius = 220

      items.forEach((item, index) => {
        const startAngle = index * slice
        const endAngle = (index + 1) * slice
        const path = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'path')
        path.setAttribute('d', describeSector(center, center, radius, startAngle, endAngle))
        path.setAttribute('fill', palette[index % palette.length])
        path.setAttribute('stroke', '#FFF6E9')
        path.setAttribute('stroke-width', '3')
        svg.appendChild(path)

        const labelAngle = startAngle + slice / 2
        const labelPoint = polarToCartesian(center, center, radius * 0.66, labelAngle)
        const text = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text')
        text.setAttribute('x', String(labelPoint.x))
        text.setAttribute('y', String(labelPoint.y))
        text.setAttribute('fill', '#FFF8EE')
        text.setAttribute('font-size', items.length > 10 ? '11' : '13')
        text.setAttribute('font-weight', '700')
        text.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle')
        text.setAttribute('dominant-baseline', 'middle')
        text.setAttribute('transform', `rotate(${labelAngle} ${labelPoint.x} ${labelPoint.y})`)
        text.textContent = truncate(item.dish, items.length > 10 ? 8 : 12)
        svg.appendChild(text)
      })

      const innerRing = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'circle')
      innerRing.setAttribute('cx', '260')
      innerRing.setAttribute('cy', '260')
      innerRing.setAttribute('r', '76')
      innerRing.setAttribute('fill', '#FFF8EC')
      innerRing.setAttribute('stroke', '#3B332B')
      innerRing.setAttribute('stroke-width', '5')
      svg.appendChild(innerRing)

      const centerTextTop = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text')
      centerTextTop.setAttribute('x', '260')
      centerTextTop.setAttribute('y', '245')
      centerTextTop.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle')
      centerTextTop.setAttribute('fill', '#6B2B10')
      centerTextTop.setAttribute('font-size', '13')
      centerTextTop.setAttribute('font-weight', '700')
      centerTextTop.textContent =
        state.selectedBuilding === 'all' ? '全部楼宇' : state.selectedBuilding
      svg.appendChild(centerTextTop)

      const centerTextBottom = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'text')
      centerTextBottom.setAttribute('x', '260')
      centerTextBottom.setAttribute('y', '278')
      centerTextBottom.setAttribute('text-anchor', 'middle')
      centerTextBottom.setAttribute('fill', '#2D241C')
      centerTextBottom.setAttribute('font-size', '24')
      centerTextBottom.setAttribute('font-weight', '900')
      centerTextBottom.textContent = `${items.length} 选 1`
      svg.appendChild(centerTextBottom)
    }

    function renderBuildingControls() {
      const options = ['all', ...state.buildings]
      nodes.buildingSelect.innerHTML = options
        .map((building) => {
          const label = building === 'all' ? '全部楼宇' : building
          return `<option value="${label === building ? building : 'all'}">${label}</option>`
        })
        .join('')
      nodes.buildingSelect.value = state.selectedBuilding

      nodes.buildingChips.innerHTML = options
        .map((building) => {
          const label = building === 'all' ? '全部楼宇' : building
          const active = state.selectedBuilding === building
          return `<button class="building-chip${active ? ' active' : ''}" data-building="${building}" type="button">${label}</button>`
        })
        .join('')
    }

    function renderCandidateList() {
      if (!state.filteredData.length) {
        nodes.candidateList.innerHTML = `
          <div class="candidate-empty">
            <strong>还没有候选菜品</strong>
            <p>先载入示例菜单，或者自己导入一份 JSON。</p>
          </div>
        `
        return
      }

      nodes.candidateList.innerHTML = state.filteredData
        .map((item) => {
          const tags = item.tags.length
            ? item.tags.map((tag) => `<span>${tag}</span>`).join('')
            : '<span>待补标签</span>'
          return `
            <article class="candidate-item">
              <div>
                <p class="candidate-place">${item.building} · ${item.restaurant} · ${item.stall}</p>
                <h3>${item.dish}</h3>
              </div>
              <div class="candidate-meta">
                <div class="candidate-tags">${tags}</div>
                <strong>${formatPrice(item.price)}</strong>
              </div>
            </article>
          `
        })
        .join('')
    }

    function renderResultTicket() {
      if (!state.lastResult) {
        nodes.resultTicket.className = 'result-ticket empty'
        nodes.resultTicket.innerHTML = `
          <p class="ticket-building">等待转盘</p>
          <h3>载入菜单后，按下“转一次”</h3>
          <p class="ticket-meta">这里会显示楼宇、餐厅、档口、标签和价格。</p>
        `
        nodes.resultBrief.textContent = '等待开转'
        return
      }

      const item = state.lastResult
      nodes.resultTicket.className = 'result-ticket'
      nodes.resultTicket.innerHTML = `
        <p class="ticket-building">${item.building}</p>
        <h3>${item.dish}</h3>
        <p class="ticket-meta">${item.restaurant} · ${item.stall}</p>
        <div class="ticket-tags">
          ${item.tags.length ? item.tags.map((tag) => `<span>${tag}</span>`).join('') : '<span>待补标签</span>'}
        </div>
        <p class="ticket-price">${formatPrice(item.price)}</p>
      `
      nodes.resultBrief.textContent = item.dish
    }

    function renderSummary() {
      nodes.currentBuilding.textContent =
        state.selectedBuilding === 'all' ? '全部楼宇' : state.selectedBuilding
      nodes.candidateCount.textContent = String(state.filteredData.length)
    }

    function renderAll() {
      applyFilter()
      renderBuildingControls()
      renderCandidateList()
      renderResultTicket()
      renderSummary()
      renderWheel()
    }

    function chooseRandomItem() {
      if (state.spinning || !state.filteredData.length) return
      state.spinning = true
      nodes.spinAction.disabled = true

      const selectedIndex = Math.floor(Math.random() * state.filteredData.length)
      const selectedItem = state.filteredData[selectedIndex]
      const sector = 360 / state.filteredData.length
      const spins = 6 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 4)
      state.currentRotation += spins * 360 - selectedIndex * sector - sector / 2
      nodes.wheelFace.style.transform = `rotate(${state.currentRotation}deg)`

      window.setTimeout(() => {
        state.lastResult = selectedItem
        renderResultTicket()
        state.spinning = false
        nodes.spinAction.disabled = false
      }, 4300)
    }

    async function loadSampleData() {
      try {
        const response = await fetch(samplePath)
        const json = await response.json()
        loadData(Array.isArray(json) ? json : [], '示例菜单')
      } catch (error) {
        setImportMessage('示例菜单加载失败。你也可以直接粘贴 JSON 自己导入。', 'error')
      }
    }

    function handleManualImport() {
      try {
        const parsed = JSON.parse(nodes.jsonInput.value)
        loadData(Array.isArray(parsed) ? parsed : [], '手动粘贴 JSON')
      } catch (error) {
        setImportMessage('JSON 解析失败，请检查逗号、引号和数组格式。', 'error')
      }
    }

    function handleFileImport(event) {
      const [file] = event.target.files || []
      if (!file) return
      const reader = new FileReader()
      reader.onload = () => {
        try {
          const parsed = JSON.parse(String(reader.result || '[]'))
          loadData(Array.isArray(parsed) ? parsed : [], `文件 ${file.name}`)
        } catch (error) {
          setImportMessage(`文件 ${file.name} 不是有效 JSON。`, 'error')
        }
      }
      reader.readAsText(file, 'utf-8')
    }

    function bindEvents() {
      nodes.spinAction.addEventListener('click', chooseRandomItem)
      nodes.loadSample.addEventListener('click', loadSampleData)
      nodes.applyJson.addEventListener('click', handleManualImport)
      nodes.fileInput.addEventListener('change', handleFileImport)
      nodes.buildingSelect.addEventListener('change', (event) => {
        state.selectedBuilding = event.target.value
        state.lastResult = null
        renderAll()
      })
      nodes.buildingChips.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
        const target = event.target.closest('[data-building]')
        if (!target) return
        state.selectedBuilding = target.dataset.building
        state.lastResult = null
        renderAll()
      })
    }

    bindEvents()
    renderAll()
    loadSampleData()
  </script>

  <style>
    :global(body) {
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(242, 106, 46, 0.16), transparent 35%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #fff8ed 0%, #f5ecd9 100%);
    }

    .canteen-page {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      padding: 1.5rem 0 3rem;
    }

    .hero-panel,
    .control-card,
    .result-card,
    .roadmap-panel {
      border: 1px solid rgba(103, 76, 48, 0.18);
      background: rgba(255, 249, 238, 0.86);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(84, 61, 34, 0.08);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    }

    .hero-panel {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      align-items: center;
      border-radius: 2rem;
      padding: 1.4rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-panel::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: auto 1.2rem 1rem auto;
      width: 6rem;
      height: 6rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px dashed rgba(134, 99, 59, 0.28);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-copy {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .eyebrow,
    .card-kicker,
    .status-label,
    .schema-label {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: #8d6b49;
    }

    h1,
    h2,
    h3,
    strong,
    .wheel-hub,
    .building-chip,
    .primary-btn,
    .ghost-btn,
    .upload-btn {
      font-family:
        'Satoshi Variable', 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 7vw, 5.3rem);
      line-height: 0.92;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      color: #26160d;
      text-wrap: balance;
      max-width: 8ch;
    }

    .hero-text,
    .roadmap-panel p,
    .helper-text,
    .ticket-meta,
    .candidate-place {
      margin: 0;
      color: #5f5348;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .hero-actions,
    .import-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .primary-btn,
    .ghost-btn,
    .upload-btn,
    .field-select {
      appearance: none;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid #8a5a31;
      min-height: 2.9rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition:
        transform 180ms ease,
        background-color 180ms ease,
        color 180ms ease,
        border-color 180ms ease;
    }

    .primary-btn {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2f2017 0%, #7a2f11 48%, #f26a2e 100%);
      color: #fff8ef;
      font-weight: 800;
      box-shadow: 0 14px 24px rgba(146, 66, 28, 0.22);
    }

    .ghost-btn,
    .upload-btn,
    .field-select {
      background: rgba(255, 248, 238, 0.9);
      color: #4f3422;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .ghost-btn.small {
      min-height: 2.7rem;
      padding-inline: 1rem;
    }

    .primary-btn:hover,
    .ghost-btn:hover,
    .upload-btn:hover,
    .building-chip:hover,
    .field-select:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .primary-btn:disabled {
      opacity: 0.65;
      cursor: wait;
      transform: none;
    }

    .status-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 0.8rem;
      padding: 0.95rem;
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 241, 224, 0.9), rgba(252, 231, 206, 0.78));
      border: 1px solid rgba(158, 118, 76, 0.16);
    }

    .status-strip div {
      display: grid;
      gap: 0.2rem;
    }

    .status-strip strong {
      color: #2f2017;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .wheel-stage {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      position: relative;
      min-height: 26rem;
      padding: 1rem 0.5rem 0.5rem;
    }

